{"4702760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slashbang", "steam_appid": 4702760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras/7358692468ac4fcd5f64646e2fa91bb7.avif?t=1786409545\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras_big/7358692468ac4fcd5f64646e2fa91bb7.webp?t=1786409545 width=1560 height=535 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Slashbang, a narrative driven, movement-first first person shooter taking inspiration from games like Sonic Adventure, Jet Set Radio, and the Metal Gear series.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras/af6483a8c244bab7e43c2a5f8f8a3ff2.avif?t=1786409545\" width=1240 height=424 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed through levels with a completely unique, custom tailored movement system, shoot and slice terrorists to pieces, and take part in a narrative adventure with intrigue, high tensions, and a comedic core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras/a4ad3eac3f2b97a16ec7480997243e28.poster.avif?t=1786409545\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras/a4ad3eac3f2b97a16ec7480997243e28.webm?t=1786409545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras/a4ad3eac3f2b97a16ec7480997243e28.mp4?t=1786409545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras/8fa7e82d1a088b6dea64f01f42c33c98.avif?t=1786409545\" width=1240 height=424 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEW MOVEMENT SYSTEM - Based on design principles of Sonic games, Slashbang has more originality than just rocket jumps and bunny hopping. Drift around corners, dodge bullets in a blink, and run up walls. Easy to learn, hard to master!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DESTRUCTION - Slice through incoming bullets, props, and even enemies with Flynn's claws! Environments are destructible, and enemies can be shredded to pieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NONLINEAR PROGRESSION - Slashbang aims to have a somewhat nonlinear progression system without the down sides. Levels are hand crafted, and you can choose the order you tackle them to gain new weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STYLE - With a unique low poly, toon shaded art style akin to Jet Set Radio, and a soundtrack by Reski that evokes Hideki Naganuma and Jun Senoue, Slashbang has sights and sounds that will keep you coming back to get faster times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUBSTANCE -  Slashbang aims to have a gripping and funny story about absolute power and how it propagates. Join David, his Spector, Flynn, and a variety of other characters as they try to restore order to their city under military occupation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras/eafb23ffd63220689984868678f20572.avif?t=1786409545\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras_big/eafb23ffd63220689984868678f20572.webp?t=1786409545 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras/7358692468ac4fcd5f64646e2fa91bb7.avif?t=1786409545\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras_big/7358692468ac4fcd5f64646e2fa91bb7.webp?t=1786409545 width=1560 height=535 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Slashbang, a narrative driven, movement-first first person shooter taking inspiration from games like Sonic Adventure, Jet Set Radio, and the Metal Gear series.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras/af6483a8c244bab7e43c2a5f8f8a3ff2.avif?t=1786409545\" width=1240 height=424 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed through levels with a completely unique, custom tailored movement system, shoot and slice terrorists to pieces, and take part in a narrative adventure with intrigue, high tensions, and a comedic core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras/a4ad3eac3f2b97a16ec7480997243e28.poster.avif?t=1786409545\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras/a4ad3eac3f2b97a16ec7480997243e28.webm?t=1786409545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras/a4ad3eac3f2b97a16ec7480997243e28.mp4?t=1786409545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras/8fa7e82d1a088b6dea64f01f42c33c98.avif?t=1786409545\" width=1240 height=424 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEW MOVEMENT SYSTEM - Based on design principles of Sonic games, Slashbang has more originality than just rocket jumps and bunny hopping. Drift around corners, dodge bullets in a blink, and run up walls. Easy to learn, hard to master!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DESTRUCTION - Slice through incoming bullets, props, and even enemies with Flynn's claws! Environments are destructible, and enemies can be shredded to pieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NONLINEAR PROGRESSION - Slashbang aims to have a somewhat nonlinear progression system without the down sides. Levels are hand crafted, and you can choose the order you tackle them to gain new weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STYLE - With a unique low poly, toon shaded art style akin to Jet Set Radio, and a soundtrack by Reski that evokes Hideki Naganuma and Jun Senoue, Slashbang has sights and sounds that will keep you coming back to get faster times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUBSTANCE -  Slashbang aims to have a gripping and funny story about absolute power and how it propagates. Join David, his Spector, Flynn, and a variety of other characters as they try to restore order to their city under military occupation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras/eafb23ffd63220689984868678f20572.avif?t=1786409545\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/extras_big/eafb23ffd63220689984868678f20572.webp?t=1786409545 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Enter Slashbang, a narrative driven, movement-first first person shooter with an emphasis on a unique, breakneck speed movement system, stylish combat, and a distinct sense of humor.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4702760/c5e